  "content": "<div class=\"mwsgeneric-base-html parbase section\">\n\n\n\n          <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/etc/designs/canada/wet-boew/css/theme.min.css\"><div class=\"ip-cover-img ip-cover-hide-mobile\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col-md-7\">\n        <h1 property=\"name\" id=\"wb-cont\">Canada Revenue Agency (CRA)</h1>\n\n\n        <section data-ajax-replace=\"/content/dam/cra-arc/includes/chatbot.txt#eng\" class=\"wb-init wb-data-ajax-replace-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-4\"></section><a class=\"btn btn-call-to-action ip-btn\" href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/e-services/cra-login-services.html\">Sign in to a CRA account</a>\n        <p>Administers tax, benefits, and related programs for the Government of Canada and for most provinces and territories.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"clearfix\"></div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<section class=\"gc-most-requested\"><div class=\"container\">\n        <h2>Most requested</h2>\n        <ul><li><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/e-services/digital-services-businesses/payroll-deductions-online-calculator.html\">Payroll deductions calculator</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/businesses/topics/gst-hst-businesses/file-gst-hst-return/how-file.html#h_3\">Ready to file your GST/HST return</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/en/services/benefits/calendar.html\">Benefits payment dates</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/forms-publications.html\">Forms and publications</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/get-faster-help-cra.html\">Skip the Line – Get faster help from the CRA</a></li>\n           \n          \n        </ul></div>\n</section><div class=\"container mrgn-bttm-lg\">\n\n   \n\n  <section class=\"gc-srvinfo\"><h2 class=\"wb-inv\">Services and information</h2>\n    <div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd\">\n      <section class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><h3><a href=\"/en/services/taxes/income-tax.html\">Income tax</a></h3>\n        <p> Personal, business, corporation, trust, and non-resident income tax, taxes for someone who died</p>\n      </section><section class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><h3><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/payments.html\">Payments</a></h3>\n        <p>How to send money to the CRA, receive your payments, options if you are unable to pay a debt</p>\n\n      </section><section class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><h3><a href=\"/en/services/taxes/child-and-family-benefits.html\">Tax credits and benefits for individuals</a></h3>\n        <p> Payment dates, eligibility for children, caregivers, people with disabilities, workers and others</p>\n      </section><section class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><h3><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/businesses/topics/gst-hst-businesses.html\">GST/HST</a></h3>\n        <p>GST/HST accounts, collect and remit the tax, file a return, claim rebates, search the GST/HST registry </p>\n      </section><section class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><h3><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/businesses/topics/payroll.html\">Payroll</a></h3>\n        <p> Payroll accounts, deductions and contributions, information returns, and benefits and allowances</p>\n      </section><section class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><h3><a href=\"/en/services/taxes/business-registration.html\">Business registration</a></h3>\n        <p> Get a business number (BN) or program accounts, find an existing BN, changes to a business</p>\n      </section><section class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><h3><a href=\"/en/services/taxes/charities.html\">Charities and giving</a></h3>\n        <p>How to register and run a charity, charities listings, and charitable tax credits</p>\n      </section><section class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><h3><a href=\"/en/services/taxes/savings-and-pension-plans.html\">Savings and pension plans</a></h3>\n        <p>Tax-free savings accounts, registered savings plans, pooled pension plans, and plan administration </p>\n      </section><section class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><h3><a href=\"/en/services/taxes/excise-taxes-duties-and-levies.html\">Excise and specialty taxes</a></h3>\n        <p>Duties, customs, charges, tax on underused housing, luxury items, digital services revenue</p>\n      </section><section class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><h3><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/corporate/scams-fraud.html\">Scams and fraud</a></h3>\n        <p>Protect yourself against scams, how to report scams, identity theft, or tax cheating</p>\n      </section><section class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><h3><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/support-difficult-situations.html\">Support in difficult situations</a></h3>\n        <p>Tariffs, situations of abuse or disaster, CRA debt, past COVID-19 relief</p>\n      </section><section class=\"col-md-6 col-lg-4\"><h3><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/programs/about-canada-revenue-agency-cra/compliance.html\">Compliance and enforcement</a></h3>\n        <p>Reporting obligations, debt collection, audits, taxpayer relief, objections or appeals</p>\n      </section></div>\n  </section></div>\n<div class=\"most-requested well well-sm brdr-0\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <section><h2>Contact us</h2><ul class=\"wb-eqht list-unstyled mrgn-tp-lg lst-spcd-2 colcount-md-3 bold-content wb-init wb-eqht-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-5\"><li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 27px;\"><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/corporate/contact-information.html\">Contact the CRA</a></li>\n        <li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 27px;\"><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/update-information-cra.html\">Update your information</a></li>\n        <li style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 27px;\"><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/make-a-service-complaint.html\">Send service feedback</a></li>\n      </ul></section></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"col-md-8\">\n      <section><h2>About the CRA</h2>\n        <ul class=\"list-unstyled bold-content mrgn-tp-lg lst-spcd-2 colcount-md-2\"><li><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/corporate/about-canada-revenue-agency-cra/mission-vision-values.html\">Mandate</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/corporate/about-canada-revenue-agency-cra/canada-revenue-agency-structure-operational-framework.html\">Organizational structure</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/corporate/about-canada-revenue-agency-cra/transparency-proactive-disclosure-canada-revenue-agency.html\">Transparency</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/corporate/about-canada-revenue-agency-cra/accessibility.html\">Accessibility</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/corporate/careers-cra.html\">Job opportunities</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/programs/about-canada-revenue-agency-cra/corporate-reports-information.html\">Reports</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/corporate/about-canada-revenue-agency-cra/taxpayer-bill-rights.html\">Taxpayer Bill of Rights</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/corporate/security.html\">Security and privacy</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/corporate/about-canada-revenue-agency-cra/accessibility/submitting-feedback-about-accessibility.html\">Submit accessibility feedback</a></li>\n          <li>More: <a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/corporate/about-canada-revenue-agency-cra.html\">About the CRA</a></li>\n        </ul></section></div>\n    <div class=\"col-md-4\">\n      <section class=\"gc-followus\"><h2>On social media</h2>\n        <ul><li><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/canrevagency\" class=\"facebook\" rel=\"external\"><span class=\"wb-inv\">Facebook: </span>CanRevAgency</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"https://twitter.com/CanRevAgency\" class=\"twitter\" rel=\"external\"><span class=\"wb-inv\">X: </span>CanRevAgency</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/CanRevAgency\" class=\"youtube\" rel=\"external\"><span class=\"wb-inv\">YouTube: </span>CanRevAgency</a></li>\n          <li><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/cra-arc\" class=\"linkedin\" rel=\"external\"><span class=\"wb-inv\">LinkedIn: </span>cra-arc</a></li>\n          <li><a rel=\"external\" class=\"instagram\" href=\"http://www.instagram.com/canrevagency\"><span class=\"wb-inv\">Instagram: </span>CanRevAgency</a></li>\n        </ul></section><section id=\"facebook\" class=\"modal-dialog modal-content overlay-def mfp-hide\"><header class=\"modal-header\"><h2 class=\"modal-title\" id=\"lbx-title\">Facebook</h2>\n        </header><div class=\"modal-body\">\n          <ul class=\"list-unstyled lst-spcd\"><li> <a href=\"#\" rel=\"external\">[First Facebook account title]</a> </li>\n            <li> <a href=\"#\" rel=\"external\">[Second Facebook account title]</a> </li>\n          </ul></div>\n        <div class=\"modal-footer\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary pull-left popup-modal-dismiss\">Close<span class=\"wb-inv\">Close overlay</span></button>\n        </div>\n      </section></div>\n  </div>\n  <br><section class=\"gc-minister\"><div class=\"row\">\n        \n        <section class=\"col-md-6 gc-minister\"><h2 class=\"h3\">Minister</h2>\n            <div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd\">\n                <section class=\"col-xs-12\"><div class=\"row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-7 pull-right\">\n                            <h3><a href=\"/en/government/ministers/francois-philippe-champagne.html\">The Honourable François-Philippe Champagne</a></h3>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-5\">\n                            <img class=\"img-responsive\" src=\"/content/dam/cra-arc/fran%C3%A7ois-philippe-champagne.jpg\" alt=\"The Honourable François-Philippe Champagne\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-7\">\n                            <p>Minister of Finance and National Revenue</p>\n                            \n                        </div>\n</div>\n                </section></div>\n        </section><section class=\"col-md-6 gc-minister\"><h2 class=\"h3\">Secretary of State</h2>\n            <div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd\">\n                <section class=\"col-xs-12\"><div class=\"row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-7 pull-right\">\n                            <h3>\n                            <a href=\"/en/government/secretaries-of-state/wayne-long.html\">The Honourable Wayne Long</a>\n                            </h3>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-5\">\n                            <img class=\"img-responsive\" src=\"/content/dam/cra-arc/wayne-long.jpg\" alt=\"The Honourable Wayne Long\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-7\">\n                            <p>Secretary of State (Canada Revenue Agency and Financial Institutions)</p>\n                       \n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n                </section></div>\n        </section><section class=\"col-md-6 gc-minister\"><h2 class=\"h3\">Parliamentary secretary</h2>\n            <div class=\"row wb-eqht-grd\">\n                <section class=\"col-xs-12\"><div class=\"row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-7 pull-right\">\n                            <h3>\n                            <a href=\"/en/government/management/ryan-turnbull.html\">Ryan Turnbull</a>\n                            </h3>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-5\">\n                            <img class=\"img-responsive\" src=\"/content/dam/cra-arc/ryan-turnbull.jpg\" alt=\"Ryan Turnbull\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-7\">\n                            <p>Parliamentary Secretary to the Minister of Finance and National Revenue and Parliamentary Secretary to the Secretary of State (Canada Revenue Agency and Financial Institutions)</p>\n                       \n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n                </section></div>\n        </section></div>\n\n\n\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"col-xs-12 col-md-4\">\n        <h2 class=\"h3\">Taxpayers' Ombudsperson</h2>\n        <h3><a href=\"https://www.canada.ca/en/taxpayers-ombudsperson.html\">Office of the Taxpayers' Ombudsperson</a></h3>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <section class=\"col-md-4 wb-feeds limit-3 gc-nws wb-init wb-feeds-inited\" id=\"wb-auto-6\"><h2 class=\"h3\">News</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"feeds-cont list-unstyled lst-spcd feed-active\"><li><a data-ajax=\"https://api.io.canada.ca/io-server/gc/news/en/v2?dept=revenueagency&amp;sort=publishedDate&amp;orderBy=desc&amp;publishedDate&gt;=2020-08-09&amp;pick=100\" href=\"https://api.io.canada.ca/io-server/gc/news/en/v2?dept=revenueagency&amp;sort=publishedDate&amp;orderBy=desc&amp;publishedDate%3E=2021-07-23&amp;pick=50&amp;format=atom&amp;atomtitle=Canada%20Revenue%20Agency\" id=\"wb-auto-7\">CRA news and tax tips</a> </li>\n      </ul><p>More: <a href=\"/en/revenue-agency/news/newsroom.html\" class=\"admin\">CRA news and tax tips</a></p>\n    </section><section class=\"col-md-8 gc-prtts\"><h2 class=\"h3\">Features</h2><div class=\"row wb-eqht wb-init\">\n        <div class=\"col-md-6 mrgn-bttm-md\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 401px;\"> <a class=\"hght-inhrt\" href=\"/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/individuals/community-volunteer-income-tax-program/lend-a-hand-community-organizations.html\" data-gc-analytics=\"promo:promotionalfeature\">\n          <section class=\"well well-sm brdr-rds-0 hght-inhrt\"><img class=\"img-responsive full-width\" alt=\"\" src=\"/content/dam/cra-arc/camp-promo/features/cvitp-ftr-2.jpg\"><h3 class=\"h5 mrgn-lft-sm\">Host a Free Tax Clinic</h3>\n            <p class=\"mrgn-lft-sm\">Register your organization to help individuals with a modest income access credits and benefits.</p>\n          </section></a> </div>\n        \n        \n        <div class=\"col-md-6 mrgn-bttm-md\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-height: 401px;\"> <a class=\"hght-inhrt\" href=\"/en/revenue-agency/news/cra-multimedia-library/podcasts.html\" data-gc-analytics=\"promo:promotionalfeature\">\n          <section class=\"well well-sm brdr-rds-0 hght-inhrt\"><img class=\"img-responsive full-width\" alt=\"\" src=\"/content/dam/cra-arc/camp-promo/features/ft-txlg_pdcst.jpg\"><h3 class=\"h5 mrgn-lft-sm\">Taxology podcast</h3>\n            <p class=\"mrgn-lft-sm\">Here for your listening pleasure, and to help you understand taxes. Tune in today! </p>\n          </section></a> </div>\n      </div>\n      \n    </section></div>\n</div>\n \n\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"mwsmediaplayer section\">\n\n    <chatbot ng-version=\"20.3.16\" _nghost-ng-c88585159=\"\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c88585159=\"\" class=\"flex parent-container\"><app-chatbot _ngcontent-ng-c88585159=\"\" _nghost-ng-c2020102212=\"\" style=\"--adaptiveCardButtonColor: #FFFFFF; --adaptiveCardButtonTextColor: #000000; --adaptiveCardButtonHoverColor: #26374A; --adaptiveCardButtonTextColorOnHover: #FFFFFF; --menuBackgroundColor: #F5F5F5; --messageErrorColor: #EB0000; --sendboxErrorColor: #E00000; --bubbleBackgroundColor: #FFFFFF; --bubbleBorderColor: #33465C88; --navigationOverlayBackground: #FFFFFF; --navigationOverlayText: #000000; --navigationOverlayRect1: #DDDDDD; --navigationOverlayRect2: #000000; --navigationOverlayRect3: #BABBBD; --outlineBorder: #000000; --fontColor: #222222; --linkColor: #284162; --linkHoverColor: #0535D2; --linkVisitedColor: #7834BC; --fontSliderValue: 16px; --saturationValue: 1; --chatHeight: 600px; --chatWidth: 400px;\"><div _ngcontent-ng-c2020102212=\"\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-roledescription=\"service message\" role=\"log\" class=\"visually-hidden\"> \n</div><app-minimized-widget _ngcontent-ng-c2020102212=\"